  "longBusinessSummary": "Fast Finance24 Holding AG, through its investments, primarily engages in the provision of various platforms and software products in finance, marketing, communication, and IT sectors in Germany and rest of Europe. The company offers ff24 Payments (ff24payments.com), a payment processing solution; ff24 Pay, a banking app available for iOS, android, and desktop PCs; OK.de, an online platform that provides email, diskspace, organizing, cloud storage, infotainment, and videos solutions; OK.secure, a platform that provides secure communication with chat, video calls, and cloud storage; DigiClerck (digiclerck.com), a tool that automates the extraction of vital data for CPAs and REITs; and ff24 Invest, an investment platform. It also provides FF24 Rent, an online payment platform for online shop and retailer; Digisell, a digital POS platform that enables merchants and enterprises to build, operate, and control business on relevant digital channels; constructs and rents containers as accommodation under TownBoxx brand name to urban workers, fitters, craftsmen and business travelers, tourists, and students; and provides logistics services under the URBAN CARGO brand name. The company was formerly known as SCY Beteiligungen AG and changed its name to Fast Finance24 Holding AG in February 2019. Fast Finance24 Holding AG was founded in 2003 and is based in Berlin, Germany.",
